      "text": "**Section 3. Implementation.** All Agencies shall post the Single-Sex Facility Policy in conspicuous locations to their personnel and members of the public using their services within three months of the Effective Date of this Order. Agencies may seek guidance on implementation from the City Commission on Human Rights and Department of Citywide Administrative Services (\"DCAS\").",
