      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**Section 4. Training.** All Agencies shall provide supervisory and frontline staff training approved by DCAS on transgender diversity and inclusion, including the requirements of this Executive Order. The training for supervisory staff shall be completed within one year of the effective date of this Order and every two years thereafter. The training for frontline staff shall be completed within two years of the effective date of this Order and every two years thereafter. DCAS will make such training available to Agencies.",
